# dx_app — Cursor Rules

## Overview
dx_app provides 497 model variants across 29 AI tasks with Python (4 variants) and C++ examples. All 497 have a downloadable `.dxnn`.

## Context Routing
| Task | Read |
|---|---|
| Python app | `.deepx/skills/dx-agent-app-build-python/SKILL.md` |
| C++ app | `.deepx/skills/dx-agent-app-build-cpp/SKILL.md` |
| Async/performance | `.deepx/skills/dx-agent-app-build-async/SKILL.md` |
